#50 rebuilt candidacy around `origin.kind` — the Claude CLI's own statement of what produced a user-role record. Rule 1 in `src/matching/candidates.ts` (see the header comment at :51-62) is:

> `origin.kind` present and not `"human"` → the CLI is telling us it produced this record. Not a prompt. **Unknown kinds default CLOSED.**

